    "It cannot be undone. Names already in the notes are not touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non si può annullare. I nomi già nelle note non vengono toccati."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden. Bereits in den Notizen stehende Namen bleiben erhalten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se puede deshacer. Los nombres que ya están en las notas no se modifican."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette action est irréversible. Les noms déjà présents dans les notes ne sont pas modifiés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It cannot be undone. Notes and Transcripts in the notes folder are not touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non si può annullare. Note e trascrizioni nella cartella delle note non vengono toccate."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden. Notizen und Transkripte im Notizenordner bleiben unberührt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se puede deshacer. Las notas y transcripciones en la carpeta de notas no se modifican."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette action est irréversible. Les notes et transcriptions dans le dossier de notes ne sont pas touchées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It gets only the text of the Transcript and your notes, never the audio.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Riceve solo il testo della Trascrizione e delle tue note, mai l’audio."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es erhält nur den Text des Transkripts und deiner Notizen, niemals das Audio."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo recibe el texto de la transcripción y tus notas, nunca el audio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il ne reçoit que le texte de la transcription et vos notes, jamais l’audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It suggests who was invited to the event, and recognises the voices you named before, only on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suggerisce chi era invitato all’evento e riconosce le voci che hai già nominato, solo su questo Mac."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es schlägt die eingeladenen Teilnehmer vor und erkennt bereits benannte Stimmen wieder – nur auf diesem Mac."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sugiere las personas invitadas al evento y reconoce las voces que ya nombraste, solo en este Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il suggère les personnes invitées à l’événement et reconnaît les voix déjà nommées, uniquement sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It transcribes them on this Mac: the audio never leaves it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Li trascrive su questo Mac: l’audio non esce mai da qui."
